Merit Based Scholarship,"Terms and Conditions
The following conditions shall be applicable:

Two Scholarships cannot be availed at a time. If the student is eligible for more than one scholarship, then he/she has the right to opt any one scholarship.
All those students who want to avail any of the above scholarships are required to apply for anyone on a prescribed application form available below.
Subsequent continuation of scholarship in every semester is based on:
Maintaining of minimum CGPA requirement of the degree program
On taking off full course load as specified for each program.
Scholarships are NOT awarded:
During the Summer semester.
If the duration of studies exceeds normal specified duration for each program.
If a student takes any regular semester break.
If the total credit hours registered (after Add/Drop period) are less than full course load.
No F/W/I and Repeat course in the transcript in last registered semester.
Student convicted by the Discipline Committee will be ineligible for any Scholarship/Award.
Incomplete application will not be accepted. University has rights to cancel any application without any notice.
